msgid "caulier dot gilles at gmail dot com"
msgstr "caulier dot gilles at gmail dot com"

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Kipi JPEG lossless plugin is a tool to transform the images without loss "
"in quality due to compression."
msgstr ""
"The Kipi JPEG gubitak plugin je alat za pretvaranje slike bez gubitka "
"kvaliteta zbog kompresije."

#. Tag: keyword
#: jpeglossless.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: jpeglossless.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Kipi"
msgstr "Kipi"

#. Tag: title
#: jpeglossless.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "JPEG Loss Less"
msgstr "JPEG Gubitak Manje"

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This plugin is available from within the host application. It allows (for "
"the below listed transformations) saving images in JPEG format, which "
"usually loses precision every time you save it (otherwise there would be no "
"size reduction), without losing any quality nor metadata information:"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj dodatak je dostupan unutar aplikacije domaćina. Ono dozvoljava (za "
"slijedeće transformacije) čuvanje slika u JPEG formata, koji uobičajno gube "
"preciznost svaki put kad je sačuvate (drugačije ne bi bilo redukcije "
"veličine), bez gubljenja kvalitete niti metapodataka informacije."

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do lossless JPEG 90/180/270 Degree Rotation."
msgstr "Učinite bez gubitka JPEG 90/180/270 Stupanj Rotacije."

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do lossless JPEG Horizontal or Vertical flip."
msgstr "Učinite bez gubitka JPEG Horizontalno ili Vertikalno zakretanje."

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do lossless JPEG black and white conversion."
msgstr "Učinite bez gubitka JPEG crnu ili bijelu konverziju."

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exif orientation tag based rotation or flip auto-adjustment."
msgstr ""
"Exif orijentacija označena na bazi rotacije ili promijeni auto-podešavanje."

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do lossless recompression of JPEG images."
msgstr "Učinite bez gubitka rekompresiju JPGE slika."

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As a consequence of the lossless storage the file size will be larger "
"(similar to the lossless PNG format) since there's no compression of the "
"color coding information."
msgstr ""
"Kao posljedica formata bez gubitka skladištenja veličina datoteke će biti "
"veća ( slično PNG formatu bez gubitka) jer nema kompresije podataka o "
"kodiranju boje."
